    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to OAsys!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new extreme sport is taking the valley by storm, and what better way to promote it than with a tournament? You play as The Pilot and their army of speedbots\u2014built to run, crash, and start all over again in a frenetic time-trial race! All thanks to our sponsors, of course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358220/extras/52abce6fd5b2b540bd013cacbd57611b.poster.avif?t=1750445243\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358220/extras/52abce6fd5b2b540bd013cacbd57611b.webm?t=1750445243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358220/extras/52abce6fd5b2b540bd013cacbd57611b.mp4?t=1750445243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Competition Above All!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the top spot on the leaderboard! Other contenders want the #1 rank, but you\u2019re more relentless. Replay the level as many times as needed to secure the highest score\u2014so don\u2019t hold back. Show your robot fury to the competition and dominate the leaderboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Speedbot!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This exceptionally dangerous sport is practiced only by robots designed for this purpose. Very few make it to the finish line, as countless obstacles stand in their way. Will you be the first champion of this Speedbot Tournament?<br><br><strong>A Breathtaking Valley!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The races take place in a sprawling landscape, blending natural and industrial settings with a solarpunk-inspired art direction. You\u2019ll die often\u2014but what a stunning valley to behold as you do!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Race through 10 levels</strong> with increasing difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Improve your mastery</strong> of the character and the environment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Use gameplay elements</strong> to optimize your path and get the best time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0- Survive obstacles</strong> during your run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Climb the Leaderboard</strong> and compare your scores with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Earn as many Medals as possible</strong> ! aim higher and higher !<br><br><strong>Game Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A <strong>main campaign mode</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A <strong>&quot;level chaining&quot; mode</strong>: If you die, you go back to the first level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Each level comes with <strong>challenges to complete</strong> ! can you finish it 100%?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to OAsys!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new extreme sport is taking the valley by storm, and what better way to promote it than with a tournament? You play as The Pilot and their army of speedbots\u2014built to run, crash, and start all over again in a frenetic time-trial race! All thanks to our sponsors, of course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358220/extras/52abce6fd5b2b540bd013cacbd57611b.poster.avif?t=1750445243\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358220/extras/52abce6fd5b2b540bd013cacbd57611b.webm?t=1750445243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358220/extras/52abce6fd5b2b540bd013cacbd57611b.mp4?t=1750445243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Competition Above All!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the top spot on the leaderboard! Other contenders want the #1 rank, but you\u2019re more relentless. Replay the level as many times as needed to secure the highest score\u2014so don\u2019t hold back. Show your robot fury to the competition and dominate the leaderboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Speedbot!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This exceptionally dangerous sport is practiced only by robots designed for this purpose. Very few make it to the finish line, as countless obstacles stand in their way. Will you be the first champion of this Speedbot Tournament?<br><br><strong>A Breathtaking Valley!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The races take place in a sprawling landscape, blending natural and industrial settings with a solarpunk-inspired art direction. You\u2019ll die often\u2014but what a stunning valley to behold as you do!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Race through 10 levels</strong> with increasing difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Improve your mastery</strong> of the character and the environment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Use gameplay elements</strong> to optimize your path and get the best time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0- Survive obstacles</strong> during your run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Climb the Leaderboard</strong> and compare your scores with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Earn as many Medals as possible</strong> ! aim higher and higher !<br><br><strong>Game Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A <strong>main campaign mode</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A <strong>&quot;level chaining&quot; mode</strong>: If you die, you go back to the first level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Each level comes with <strong>challenges to complete</strong> ! can you finish it 100%?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
